<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">tutorial</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">tutorial</ansi> command takes a brand-new character back to
the newcomers' pool in Pothole Coulee, where the world begins. It is the
safety net for a player who chose the "veteran" start by mistake and would
rather learn the ropes after all.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">tutorial</ansi>           Travel to the newcomers' pool.

It only works for characters still at the very start of their journey. Once
you have made real progress in the world, the coulee is behind you and the
command politely declines.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help look</ansi>
